sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor OP as Operator
    participant REG as Registry Program
    participant CO as CompanyAccount PDA
    participant TR as TreasuryAccount PDA
    participant PO as PolicyAccount PDA
    participant AG as AgentAccount PDA

    Note over OP,AG: Phase 1 — Company Creation
    OP->>REG: create_company(nonce, metadata_uri)
    REG->>CO: init PDA seeds=company+OP+nonce
    REG->>TR: init PDA seeds=treasury+CO
    REG->>PO: init default PolicyAccount
    REG-->>OP: company_pda address

    Note over OP,AG: Phase 2 — Agent Registration
    OP->>OP: derive keypair via SLIP-0010<br/>m/44h/501h/0h/0h
    OP->>REG: register_agent(company, agent_address, Derived, index=0)
    REG->>AG: init PDA seeds=agent+CO+0
    REG-->>OP: agent_pda address

    Note over OP,AG: Phase 3 — Key Rotation
    OP->>OP: derive new keypair at index=1
    OP->>REG: update_agent(new_address, derivation_index=1)
    REG->>AG: mutate agent_address + derivation_index<br/>PDA address unchanged
    REG-->>OP: ok — reputation preserved

    Note over OP,AG: Phase 4 — Authority Transfer
    OP->>REG: transfer_authority(new_authority)
    REG->>CO: mutate controlling_authority<br/>PDA address unchanged
    REG-->>OP: ok — company identity intact
